  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nHi!\n\nI use the System Health Monitoring to view my proxmox instance. It would be nice if the widget would save the last state of the accordion. On reload, all entries are closed again, but I would like to be able to choose what is visible/open on default. Like I would have the VMs and LCXs entries visible all the time. \n\nMy idea would be to just save the last state. I think that would be the easiest solution imo.\n\nAnd thanks for your great work!\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
